      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"1724 characters\">&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: center;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Offer Letter&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\r\\n</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"1724 characters\">                    <span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\r\\n</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"1724 characters\">                    &lt;p&gt;Dear {applicant_name},&lt;/p&gt;<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\r\\n</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"1724 characters\">                    <span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\r\\n</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"1724 characters\">                    &lt;p&gt;{app_name} is excited to bring you on board as {job_title}.&lt;/p&gt;<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\r\\n</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"1724 characters\">                    <span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\r\\n</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"1724 characters\">                    &lt;p&gt;Were just a few formalities away from getting down to work. Please take the time to review our formal offer. It includes important details about your compensation, benefits, and the terms and conditions of your anticipated employment with {app_name}.&lt;/p&gt;<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\r\\n</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"1724 characters\">                    <span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\r\\n</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"1724 characters\">                    &lt;p&gt;{app_name} is offering a {job_type}. position for you as {job_title}, reporting to [immediate manager/supervisor] starting on {start_date} at{workplace_location}. Expected hours of work are{days_of_week}.&lt;/p&gt;<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\r\\n</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"1724 characters\">                    <span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\r\\n</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"1724 characters\">                    &lt;p&gt;In this position, {app_name} is offering to start you at a pay rate of {salary} per {salary_type}. You will be paid on a{salary_duration} basis.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\r\\n</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"1724 characters\">                    <span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\r\\n</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"1724 characters\">                    &lt;p&gt;As part of your compensation, were also offering [if applicable, youll describe your bonus, profit sharing, commission structure, stock options, and compensation committee rules here].&lt;/p&gt;<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\r\\n</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"1724 characters\">                    <span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\r\\n</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"1724 characters\">                    &lt;p&gt;As an employee of {app_name} , you will be eligible for briefly name benefits, such as health insurance, stock plan, dental insurance, etc.&lt;/p&gt;<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\r\\n</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"1724 characters\">                    <span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\r\\n</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"1724 characters\">                    &lt;p&gt;Please indicate your agreement with these terms and accept this offer by signing and dating this agreement on or before {offer_expiration_date}.&lt;/p&gt;<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\r\\n</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"1724 characters\">                    <span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\r\\n</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"1724 characters\">                    &lt;p&gt;Sincerely,&lt;/p&gt;<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\r\\n</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"1724 characters\">                    &lt;p&gt;{app_name}&lt;/p&gt;</span>
      \"\"\"
