      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"2255 characters\"><span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\r\\n</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"2255 characters\">&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;MsoNormal&quot;&gt;We appreciate your contributions during your tenure with us<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\r\\n</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"2255 characters\">and wish you all the best in your future professional endeavors.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;MsoNormal&quot;&gt;Thank you for your service and dedication.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;MsoNormal&quot;&gt;Sincerely,&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;MsoNormal&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;MsoNormal&quot;&gt;&lt;o:p&gt;<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\r\\n</span></span>
