      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"2255 characters\">            &lt;p class=&quot;MsoNormal&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 600;&quot;&gt;To,&lt;/span&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 600;&quot;&gt;Date&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;: {date}&lt;br&gt;{employee_name}&lt;br&gt;Pune&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Dear {employee_name},&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;MsoNormal&quot;&gt;Dear [Employee&#8217;s First Name],&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;MsoNormal&quot;&gt;This is to formally acknowledge the receipt and acceptance<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\r\\n</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"2255 characters\">of your resignation letter dated &lt;b&gt;{resignation_date}&lt;/b&gt;, from your position<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\r\\n</span></span>
      <span class=sf-dump-str title=\"2255 characters\">as &lt;b&gt;{designation}&lt;/b&gt;&amp;nbsp;with &lt;b&gt;{app_name}&lt;/b&gt;.&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;MsoNormal&quot;&gt;You have been relieved from your duties with effect from &lt;b&gt;{last_working_day}&lt;/b&gt;, after serving the required notice period and completing all<span class=\"sf-dump-default sf-dump-ns\">\\r\\n</span></span>
